text = "[center][font_size=32][color=#E5B842]AGE OF DRAGON[/color][/font_size]

[font_size=20]Credits[/font_size][/center]

[b]0 A.D. — Wildfire Games[/b]
Unit, building, terrain and prop art, rendered from Wildfire Games' 3D models to 2D isometric sprites.
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/)
http://www.wildfiregames.com/ · https://play0ad.com

[b]App icon, boot splash, UI art and the how-to pages[/b]
Generated by the project owner using Google Gemini. The HOW TO PLAY pages are captures of this game annotated by hand, so the art beneath the annotation is the 0 A.D. material credited above.
Google's Terms of Service (https://policies.google.com/terms) do not claim ownership of generated content and permit commercial use. Under US law purely AI-generated material is not registrable, so these files are ours to ship and are not offered under the project's licences.

[b]Typefaces[/b]
New Rocker — Vernon Adams, maintained by Cyreal. Cinzel Decorative — Natanael Gama.
Both SIL Open Font License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org/); the licence texts ship beside the fonts.

[b]Godot Engine[/b]
https://godotengine.org — MIT Licence

[b]Tools[/b]
isobake (this project's 3D-to-2D sprite pipeline), blender_pyrogenesis_importer, Blender, Pillow, NumPy.

Full provenance: CREDITS.md, game/assets/LICENCES.md and GeminiCopyRight.md in the project repository."
fit_content = true

